Problem
Create Application Load Balancer xfusion-alb with target group xfusion-tg for xfusion-ec2.

Solution
Portal Steps:

Create Security Group xfusion-sg:

Inbound: HTTP port 80 from 0.0.0.0/0

Create Target Group xfusion-tg:

Protocol: HTTP, Port: 80

Register xfusion-ec2 instance

Create ALB xfusion-alb:

Internet-facing

Security group: xfusion-sg

Listener: HTTP:80 → Forward to xfusion-tg

Update EC2 Security Group:

Allow HTTP port 80 from xfusion-sg

Test:

bash
curl http://<ALB_DNS_NAME>
